  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37885388",
      "title": "Parameters in Practice",
      "sourceHash": "ac4e76f5a6f01064c2b2f7811a502aea611a4aeef534208cb51469d6d5eb3f30",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.01,
          "end": 2.843,
          "en": "Let's have a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.843,
          "end": 6,
          "en": "at some of these parameters in practice now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6,
          "end": 9.12,
          "en": "For this, I prepared the following prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.12,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "So a photo of the ocean with light waves,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 13.8,
          "en": "should be a wide shot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.8,
          "end": 16.74,
          "en": "cotton candy clouds in the background, sunrise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.74,
          "end": 17.79,
          "en": "realistic lighting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.79,
          "end": 21.51,
          "en": "And now, after the last keyword I add,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.51,
          "end": 24.45,
          "en": "so to say to my prompt, I add a space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.45,
          "end": 27.27,
          "en": "and now these double dashes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.27,
          "end": 30.42,
          "en": "then the parameter that I want to change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.42,
          "end": 32.91,
          "en": "ar in my case, the aspect ratio.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.91,
          "end": 36.18,
          "en": "And this should be in the format of 16:9.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.18,
          "end": 38.19,
          "en": "And if we now create these images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.19,
          "end": 40.65,
          "en": "and compare the aspect ratio or the format",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.65,
          "end": 44.46,
          "en": "to the other images we created so far in this module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 47.76,
          "en": "then you will see that we now have this 16 to 9 format",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.76,
          "end": 49.893,
          "en": "applied to all of our images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 53.94,
          "en": "So we created these nice ocean images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.94,
          "end": 57.63,
          "en": "now in this 16 to 9 aspect ratio,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 61.65,
          "en": "but we can also add multiple parameters to a prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.65,
          "end": 63.993,
          "en": "If we take this once again now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.16,
          "end": 69.693,
          "en": "and after the aspect ratio, add dash, dash, no, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.62,
          "end": 72.69,
          "en": "this is a negative prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.69,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "So with this dash, dash, no parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 79.35,
          "en": "we can exclude certain objects, humans, animals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.35,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "or simply certain information from the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "Our ocean here, for example, has this blue tone in it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 88.41,
          "en": "which is quite okay, generally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.41,
          "end": 90.33,
          "en": "But let's say that I wanna exclude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.33,
          "end": 92.82,
          "en": "blue colors from this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 97.02000000000001,
          "en": "Then I simply add dash, dash, no blue here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.02000000000001,
          "end": 98.61,
          "en": "and therefore anything blue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 100.62299999999999,
          "en": "should be removed from the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "And this almost worked in this first one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 108.69,
          "en": "Yeah, we have some slight blue tone in it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.69,
          "end": 112.89,
          "en": "but generally, the overlook of the image entirely changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.89,
          "end": 115.413,
          "en": "by adding this no parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.28,
          "end": 118.17,
          "en": "As mentioned, you cannot also apply this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.17,
          "end": 120.84,
          "en": "to remove certain objects from an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.84,
          "end": 123.82,
          "en": "So if I, for example, take",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.83,
          "end": 129.83,
          "en": "maybe this \"Kill Bill\" image we created,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.89,
          "end": 135.89,
          "en": "add this prompt and now add dash, dash, no cars.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 138.84,
          "en": "The initial images all contained cars,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.84,
          "end": 140.823,
          "en": "as we have the city in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 145.68,
          "en": "This should change now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.68,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "So we shouldn't see any cars on these images now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 152.373,
          "en": "Yeah, and I think this also worked quite well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.45,
          "end": 155.49,
          "en": "So this is how you can remove objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.49,
          "end": 157.89,
          "en": "with this no parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.89,
          "end": 159.96,
          "en": "Let me give you one other example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.96,
          "end": 161.98,
          "en": "how we can use such parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.11,
          "end": 166.53300000000002,
          "en": "by again creating a nature image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.54,
          "end": 171.27,
          "en": "This time of a beautiful path through a forest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.27,
          "end": 173.88,
          "en": "with huge trees, a panorama shot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.88,
          "end": 176.97,
          "en": "Then I add some details about the way the image is shot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.97,
          "end": 179.13,
          "en": "So with the Canon camera.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 180.87,
          "en": "We have the sun shining through the trees",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.87,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "and golden colors, it's spring.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 185.86,
          "en": "And now I add again, the aspect ratio",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.7,
          "end": 193.083,
          "en": "as parameter in this initial prompt, which I'll copy now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 198.99,
          "en": "And the second prompt will be exactly the same,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.99,
          "end": 203.76,
          "en": "but I'll also add dash dash style raw now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.76,
          "end": 205.8,
          "en": "So the first prompt will create the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.8,
          "end": 210.8,
